  <h2>Speaking</h2>
  <p>World Federation of Jewish Holocaust Survivors and Descendants, 36th Annual Conference, Philadelphia, 23 to 26 October 2026. Exhibiting throughout the conference, with a Saturday workshop and a Sunday session.</p>

  <h2>Get in touch</h2>
  <p>If you are trying to find your own family and do not know where to start, or if you work with a collection this method might help, write to me. I read everything.</p>

